<title>USA: TABLE - Kellogg Co Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Kellogg Co Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BATTLE CREEK, Mich. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>		    Three months ended	     Six months ended</p>
<p>				 June 30,			June 30,</p>
<p>			    1997     1996		1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales	     $1,719.7 $1,651.4    $3,408.6  $3,437.3</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold     810.8    775.2     1,638.8   1,565.6</p>
<p>Selling and administrative</p>
<p>				617.5    708.5     1,201.2   1,355.7</p>
<p> Non-recurring charges   12.2     26.1	  12.2	35.6</p>
<p> Operating profit	 279.2    141.6	 556.4     480.4</p>
<p> Interest expense	  27.0     16.1	  52.4	29.8</p>
<p>Earnings before</p>
<p>  income taxes	    254.2    125.8	 506.2     451.3</p>
<p> Income taxes		90.6     47.7	 182.0     167.1</p>
<p> Net earnings	     163.6     78.1	 324.2     284.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.79     0.37	  1.56	1.33</p>
<p> Average shares	   207.3    212.7	 208.1     213.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 earnings before charges $0.83 vs $0.45.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 net includes after-tax charge of $0.04 a share and Q2 1996  net includes of $0.08 a share for production and operation streamlining.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
